  "description": "Stock Market Weekly Wrap Up & \"Who is Timothy?!\"",
  "body_html": "<p>If you have been with me a long time, ignore the video. </p><p><em><strong>If you are new</strong></em>…Hi! My name is Timothy 👋. I despise anonymous creators, especially in the Finance niche. No, I did not work on Wall Street (though I used to dream about it). No, I did not work at a hedge fund as an investment banker…like many of these faceless substack pages say 🙄…most of them are lying, or they sucked at their job, otherwise they wouldn’t have left.</p><p>I am a normal guy, that was eaten up by the markets, worked a 9 to 5. And with time, lots of mistakes and a lot of reading, “got good” at the markets. If you saw my very first video 5 years ago, I was more lucky than I was skilled. But the<strong> internal pressure and desire to be the best</strong> investor possible, led me to this point. </p><p>Am I the best investor in the world? Na. But I can consistently find winning stocks and have a sound, repeatable strategy that has changed my life. Why do I make content? Because I enjoy it. My college thesis nearly 20 years ago was “Predicting Stock Market Movement with Multi-Variable Regressions” (it failed miserably lol). I have a passion for forecasting, a passion for the markets, and I genuinely love making videos. </p><p>Hopefully, my content at some point has impacted you positively. </p><p>You can watch the video for the life story. Otherwise, if you missed any of the posts this week, here are the weekly wrap up highlights:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-meltdown-reminder?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Meltdown Reminder</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/flash-buy-picking-up-this-stock-that?r=4z8lgl\">This Defense Stock Broke Out Again</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/great-company-but-bad-stock?r=4z8lgl\">You Can Have a Great Company…but the Stock Price Goes Down</a></p></li></ul><h4><strong>Also: Standby for an update this afternoon. The VIX broke out literally while I was editing this video. We have talked about this VIX breakout for a few days now. We will see where it is at late trading day, and make a decision for the few remaining positions we hold. </strong></h4><p>Overall, I remain very light in the market. Positions are not working that well…and when the market is not working for us…we don’t throw more money at it and HOPE ❌. Hope is not a strategy. </p><p>Have a great weekend, be sure to relax some and detach from the charts so you are fresh next week. And last but not least: Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
